<title>FINLAND: Orion 8-mth profit rises slightly.</title>
<headline>Orion 8-mth profit rises slightly.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items     538 vs 528</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    7.17 vs 7.38</p>
<p> Net sales				   2,784 vs 2,704</p>
<p> Operating profit			    462 vs 478</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts median forecast was for a 536 million markka profit after financial items (range 511 million to 580 million).  </p>
<p>Operating profit before depreciation  603 vs 611</p>
<p> Depreciation				  141 vs 133</p>
<p> Net financial items		  gain 76  vs 50 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 nil vs 1 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					   179 vs 159</p>
<p> Net profit				    359 vs 368</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     72.2 vs 68.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish phramaceuticals company is Orion-yhtyma Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0247</p>
